{"path": "rust/library/alloc/src/boxed.rs", "line": 901, "name": "assume_init", "declaration": "unsafe fn assume_init (self) -> Box < T , A >", "parent": "Box < mem :: MaybeUninit < T > , A >", "documentation": " Converts to `Box<T, A>`.

